      "visualHeaderTooltip": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Shows the percentage of recorded trips starting on Saturdays or Sundays for each employee.\n\nCalculated as Weekend Trips divided by Total Trips.\n\nOnly employees with at least 20 recorded trips within the selected filters are displayed.\n\nA higher weekend trip rate indicates a different travel pattern, not necessarily suspicious activity. Weekend work may be part of an employee''s responsibilities.'"
